{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ca576c85c1a971c8","type":"text","text":"[[Sturingaurd.canvas]]\n#NPC ","x":-470,"y":-339,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d8533cae8aa0828b","type":"text","text":"Guldar is Stus father. \n\nGuldar is a warmonger who only believes in strength and battle. He is revolted by stupidity and weakness and is harsh on those in his village cursed with either of them. \n","x":-500,"y":-260,"width":505,"height":150},
		{"id":"7930770f8e9aebd6","type":"text","text":"A 8 foot tall Goliath who wields a great sword covered in blood that has never been cleaned. Dressed with no armor, yellow eyes, grey skin and a expressionless face. This is a man who has seen countless battles shown by the scares that are all over his body, Guldar is a man of will, hatred, power and dominance. \n","x":-500,"y":-60,"width":525,"height":150},
		{"id":"d8179f6584465f34","type":"text","text":"Guldar was born into StormCrest as the first in line to become village chief, by age 15 he was fed up with his fathers ways and hated his want for peace and exploration. Why should StormCrest aid a country that does nothing for them. Guldar murdered his father taking claim to the title as chief and has killed every villager that questioned or tried to overtake his authority. Guldar raised his warriors to act as a cult that follow him and will die for any cause he wishes. \n","x":-500,"y":120,"width":639,"height":187},
		{"id":"57f035b8de8deeb3","type":"file","file":"Player Characters/Images/Pasted image 20260915202606.png","x":180,"y":-385,"width":380,"height":692},
		{"id":"16ee2a292666f520","x":-500,"y":390,"width":505,"height":250,"type":"text","text":"Phaien:\n\nPhaien was his greatest obsession he wanted her and so he forced her father to make her marry him or their entire family would be killed. When she ran he was lost in rage and murdered every relative she had down to 3rd cousins. \n\nFor years she was protected by the city of Volstar and when the king fell he saw a opportunity and took it.\n"},
		{"id":"852e7733a2d760e3","type":"text","text":"Current:\n\n**DEAD**\n\nAs of now Guldar is raising an army of Goliath in hopes to destroy the city for taking his woman from him all those years ago. However at his curent old age of 75 he is slowly becoming weaker overtime and so he is seeking out power capable of restoring his strength. \n\nFrom the search of power he has been sending Village warriors into the ruins of Armount, most do not return and those that do are murdered if they do not bring back something of value. \n\nMost recently he sent Thenda\n","x":40,"y":365,"width":606,"height":300}
	],
	"edges":[]
}